        "t": 705.29,
        "r": 547.4760100000001,
        "b": 669.7
      },
      "content": "The printer uses a field repair strategy. Defective parts are diagnosed and replaced at the Field Replaceable Unit (FRU) assembly level. Follow some basic safety precautions to avoid injury or printer damage. Learn about the tools required to service the printer and the types of fasteners used.",
