    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0072",
      "reading_order": 87,
      "section": "Introduction",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.00413,
        "t": 527.29,
        "r": 532.3241300000002,
        "b": 503.70000000000005
      },
      "content": "Learn the overall process for troubleshooting failures and replacing parts, as well as items of note related to installing and tracking printer supplies",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_86",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1 Removal and replacement"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_86",
          "title": "Introduction"
        }
      ],
      "page": 15,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0073",
      "reading_order": 88,
      "section": "Introduction",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.00415000000001,
        "t": 494.28999999999996,
        "r": 497.38415000000026,
        "b": 482.70000000000005
      },
      "content": "Repair normally begins by using the printer internal diagnostics and the following two-step process:",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_86",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1 Removal and replacement"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_86",
          "title": "Introduction"
        }
      ],
      "page": 15,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0074",
      "reading_order": 89,
      "section": "Introduction",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.0041,
        "t": 473.29,
        "r": 495.44410000000016,
        "b": 461.7
      },
      "content": "Isolate the problem to the major system (for example, the network, the server, or the printer).",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_86",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1 Removal and replacement"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_86",
          "title": "Introduction"
        }
      ],
      "page": 15,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0075",
      "reading_order": 90,
      "section": "Introduction",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.00414,
        "t": 452.29,
        "r": 536.1641400000001,
        "b": 428.7
      },
      "content": "Identify the cause of failures according to the troubleshooting section in the printer service manual, and follow the disassembly procedures to replace the defective parts or the consumable parts.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_86",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1 Removal and replacement"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_86",
          "title": "Introduction"
        }
      ],
      "page": 15,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0076",
      "reading_order": 91,
      "section": "Introduction",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 158.34,
        "t": 416.79,
        "r": 544.4100000000003,
        "b": 405.2
      },
      "content": "See the separate control panel message document (CPMD) for this printer for control panel error",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_86",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1 Removal and replacement"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_86",
          "title": "Introduction"
        }
      ],
      "page": 15,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0077",
      "reading_order": 92,
      "section": "Introduction",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.0,
        "t": 416.79,
        "r": 333.70002999999997,
        "b": 393.2
      },
      "content": "IMPORTANT: message descriptions and solutions (also available online).",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_86",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1 Removal and replacement"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_86",
          "title": "Introduction"
        }
      ],
      "page": 15,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0078",
      "reading_order": 93,
      "section": "Introduction",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.0,
        "t": 382.29,
        "r": 527.5800000000003,
        "b": 346.7
      },
      "content": "After locating a faulty part, the printer can usually be repaired at the assembly level by replacing the field replaceable unit (FRUs). HP does not support replacement of components on the printed circuit assemblies (PCAs).",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_86",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1 Removal and replacement"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_86",
          "title": "Introduction"
        }
      ],
      "page": 15,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0079",
      "reading_order": 94,
      "section": "Introduction",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.00014999999999,
        "t": 337.29,
        "r": 503.6701500000002,
        "b": 313.7
      },
      "content": "The user replaces supplies (cartridges) as they are depleted. Additional instructions about other userreplaceable parts are provided in this section.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_86",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1 Removal and replacement"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_86",
          "title": "Introduction"
        }
      ],
      "page": 15,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0080",
      "reading_order": 95,
      "section": "Introduction",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.00018,
        "t": 304.29,
        "r": 548.8501799999999,
        "b": 268.70000000000005
      },
      "content": "The printer tracks the amount of use on the customer-replaceable supplies by keeping a page count. The printer prompts the user to replace certain items when a supply is depleted or a specific number of pages have been printed.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_86",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1 Removal and replacement"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_86",
          "title": "Introduction"
        }
      ],
      "page": 15,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0081",
      "reading_order": 96,
      "section": "Introduction",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 100.00031,
        "t": 259.28999999999996,
        "r": 539.4903100000001,
        "b": 235.70000000000005
      },
      "content": "Swapping supplies between products might be necessary in some test scenarios. However, this might cause a misrepresentation of supply life values, and is not recommended.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_86",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1 Removal and replacement"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_86",
          "title": "Introduction"
        }
      ],
      "page": 15,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
